> 
> On Tue, 17 Jun 2008, Alan Horstmann wrote:
> 
> > I have just confirmed that pasting
> > 
> > 	#define GFP_DMA32	((__force gfp_t)0x04u)
> > 
> > into /alsa-kernel/pci/emu10k1/memory.c (not a correct fix -just taken from 
